WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Proofread like an editor.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.300
Read slowly, one sentence at a time.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.540
Check capitals, then usage, then punctuation, then spelling.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:14.420
Four quick passes catch more than one long one.
